    {
      "block_id": "MP003:p0498:b0054",
      "text": "tested, and to report the results of tests so conducted. For Class III components, manufacturer's",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 125.995,
        "top": 552.347,
        "x1": 541.249,
        "bottom": 562.847
      },
      "reading_order": 54,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP003:p0498:b0055",
      "text": "trademark, pressure/temperature rating and material identification, as applicable, stamped or cast",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 125.997,
        "top": 564.347,
        "x1": 541.388,
        "bottom": 574.847
      },
      "reading_order": 55,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP003:p0498:b0056",
      "text": "on the component and verifiable against the manufacturer's catalog or similar documentation will",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 125.999,
        "top": 576.347,
        "x1": 541.337,
        "bottom": 586.847
      },
      "reading_order": 56,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP003:p0498:b0057",
      "text": "suffice.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 126.003,
        "top": 588.347,
        "x1": 157.01,
        "bottom": 598.847
      },
      "reading_order": 57,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP003:p0498:b0058",
      "text": "7.1.4 Identification",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 90.0,
        "top": 611.091,
        "x1": 182.14,
        "bottom": 621.091
      },
      "reading_order": 58,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP003:p0498:b0059",
      "text": "Where indicated as 'permanent' in 4-6-1/7.1.4 TABLE 2, the piping component is to bear",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 125.996,
        "top": 625.847,
        "x1": 541.282,
        "bottom": 636.347
      },
      "reading_order": 59,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP003:p0498:b0060",
      "text": "permanent identification, such as manufacturer's name or trademark, standard of compliance,",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 126.0,
        "top": 637.847,
        "x1": 541.317,
        "bottom": 648.347
      },
      "reading_order": 60,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP003:p0498:b0061",
      "text": "material identity, pressure rating, etc., as required by the standard of compliance or the",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 125.995,
        "top": 649.847,
        "x1": 541.27,
        "bottom": 660.347
      },
      "reading_order": 61,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP003:p0498:b0062",
      "text": "manufacturer's specification. Such markings may be cast or forged integral with, stamped on, or",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 125.999,
        "top": 661.847,
        "x1": 541.379,
        "bottom": 672.347
      },
      "reading_order": 62,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP003:p0498:b0063",
      "text": "securely affixed by nameplate on the component, and are to serve as a permanent means of",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 126.004,
        "top": 673.847,
        "x1": 541.342,
        "bottom": 684.347
      },
      "reading_order": 63,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP003:p0498:b0064",
      "text": "identification of the component throughout its service life.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 125.995,
        "top": 685.847,
        "x1": 370.971,
        "bottom": 696.347
      },
      "reading_order": 64,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP003:p0498:b0065",
      "text": "Where indicated as 'temporary', the pipe is to have identification for traceability during",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 125.995,
        "top": 708.347,
        "x1": 541.354,
        "bottom": 718.847
      },
      "reading_order": 65,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP003:p0498:b0066",
      "text": "fabrication.",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 126.004,
        "top": 720.347,
        "x1": 174.115,
        "bottom": 730.847
      },
      "reading_order": 66,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP003:p0498:b0067",
      "text": "RULES FOR BUILDING AND CLASSING MARINE VESSELS • 2021",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 77.004,
        "top": 787.056,
        "x1": 352.233,
        "bottom": 796.056
      },
      "reading_order": 67,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP003:p0498:b0068",
      "text": "494",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 526.262,
        "top": 787.056,
        "x1": 541.274,
        "bottom": 796.056
      },
      "reading_order": 68,
      "block_type": "text_line"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "MP003:p0498:b0069",
      "text": "ABS",
      "bbox": {
        "x0": 54.0,
        "top": 787.938,
        "x1": 74.502,
        "bottom": 796.938
      },
